    "headers": {
      "concept": "Sheriff of Seattle",
      "chronicle": "The Ward File",
      "ambition": "For Seattle to outlive its Prince.",
      "desire": "",
      "touchstones": "<h3>Convictions</h3><ul><li>The Beast does not rule: it is mastered</li><li>No lawless monster deserves the gift of the night</li></ul><h3>Touchstones</h3><ul><li><strong>Dr. Lucy Harlan</strong>: A Snohomish veterinarian who looks after his dogs and makes him coffee he never drinks.</li></ul>",
