      "history": ""
    },
    "biography": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.1UgmJAqeofD7SSaf]{Profile: Ethan Montgomery}</p><blockquote><p><em>“I am the guardian between the Beast and the city. If one wakes, the other falls.”</em></p></blockquote><table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Epithet</th><td>The Sentinel of Puget Sound</td></tr><tr><th>Concept</th><td>Sheriff of Seattle</td></tr><tr><th>Clan</th><td>Gangrel</td></tr><tr><th>Sect</th><td>Camarilla (out of personal loyalty to the Prince)</td></tr><tr><th>Sire</th><td>Elijah Kane (PNJ-09)</td></tr><tr><th>Born</th><td>1845</td></tr><tr><th>Embraced</th><td>1885</td></tr><tr><th>Ambition</th><td>For Seattle to outlive its Prince.</td></tr><tr><th>Coterie</th><td>@UUID[JournalEntry.azX1hjbc0PUp2AA2.JournalEntryPage.bxduXJhh2oXcM6Uy]{Whitmore&#39;s Wolves}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Demeanor</h3><p>Heavyset, weathered skin, a short salt-and-pepper beard, and huge hands; flannel, a waxed jacket, boots; amber eyes under strain.</p>",
    "appearance": "<p>Heavyset, weathered skin, a short salt-and-pepper beard, and huge hands; flannel, a waxed jacket, boots; amber eyes under strain.</p>",
